From: Quest2 port <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] qkx: hollywood retained log in ramoops dump record 1

Quest 2 ramoops (0x9ba00000+0x90000, record/console/pmsg 0x20000) lays
out dump 0x9ba00000-0x9ba50000, console -0x9ba70000, pmsg -0x9ba90000,
so the Quest Pro address 0x9ba80000 is inside pmsg, which logd rewrites
continuously. Move the 64K log to 0x9ba30000, inside dump record 1,
clear of its header. marker_read must be built with the same address
(make module QKX_LOG_PHYS=0x9ba30000).
---
--- a/init/main.c
+++ b/init/main.c
@@ -553,7 +553,8 @@
 	pti_init();
 }
 
-#define QKX_LOG_PHYS 0x9ba80000ULL
+/* hollywood: 0x9ba80000 is inside the ramoops pmsg zone; use dump record 1. */
+#define QKX_LOG_PHYS 0x9ba30000ULL
 #define QKX_LOG_SIZE 0x10000
 #define QKX_LOG_MAGIC 0x514b584c
 
